<title>USA: Multi-Market Radio buys WMYB for $1.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Multi-Market Radio buys WMYB for $1.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multi-Market Radio Inc said on Thursday that it bought WMYB (FM) radio station from Puritan Radiocasting Co for $1.1 million.</p>
<p>WMYB(FM) which plays 70s rock serves the Myrtle Beach, S.C. market.</p>
<p>In April 1996, SFX Broadcasting Inc said that it would acquire Multi-Market Radio.</p>
<p>Under the terms, Multi-Market Radio common stock shareholders will receive the stock equivalent of $12.00 per common share. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
